          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "要求 Node.js >= 22.12.0、pnpm >= 11.18.0；具体版本与命令以根 package.json 和 pnpm-lock.yaml 为准。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "attrs": {
            "language": "bash"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "pnpm install\n# 经用户明确要求，在当前机器预览\npnpm dev:desktop\n# 或预览 Web\npnpm dev:web\n# 验证前检查测试机连接\npnpm test:remote doctor"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
